%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dialogue_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 25e982df099754116b3863808eae6c55, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 1
    m_Localized: Hiya!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2
    m_Localized: Hope you're having a nice day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3
    m_Localized: You look exhausted.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4
    m_Localized: How are the kids?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5
    m_Localized: When are you going to retire?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6
    m_Localized: Lovely weather we're having!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7
    m_Localized: Ew was there a fish here recently? It stinks!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8
    m_Localized: Hoping for some rain this weekend.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9
    m_Localized: Did you hear they're raising our taxes?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10
    m_Localized: I'm going to see my long-distance friend! We haven't seen each other
      in years.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11
    m_Localized: I'm going on my first vacation in a decade!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12
    m_Localized: I'm running from my past.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13
    m_Localized: Did you know that train reaches speeds of up to 57 leagues per hour?!
      It's so fast!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14
    m_Localized: Hurry and punch my ticket, are you seriously checking my ID??!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15
    m_Localized: "Have you seen my propeller hat? I must\u2019ve left it on a train"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16
    m_Localized: "Have you seen my top hat? I must\u2019ve left it on a train"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17
    m_Localized: "Have you seen my green hat? I must\u2019ve left it on a train"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18
    m_Localized: "What\u2019re you looking for on my ID? You like my photo, handsome?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19
    m_Localized: "That\u2019s me in the picture, let me through already!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20
    m_Localized: "It\u2019s so hard keeping track of these tickets, back in my day
      we just kissed the conductor"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21
    m_Localized: "It\u2019s so hard keeping track of these tickets, back in my day
      we just paid at the door"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22
    m_Localized: "It\u2019s so hard keeping track of these tickets, back in my day
      we just asked for forgiveness, not permission"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23
    m_Localized: "I\u2019ve been waiting in line forever"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24
    m_Localized: Do you call it a train or a trolley?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 25
    m_Localized: My neighbor told me those shuttles take you away for good, is that
      true?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26
    m_Localized: There's something off with those researchers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27
    m_Localized: The people who come back from that lab smell funny.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28
    m_Localized: I hear screams at night sometimes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 29
    m_Localized: I heard Crustacean Corporation is experimenting on those poor people!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 30
    m_Localized: You should vote for fish rights even if you're not a fish.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31
    m_Localized: Hey at least all of the predators are doing this voluntarily. And
      they're getting paid for it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32
    m_Localized: Do you think any research positions are still open?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33
    m_Localized: "Crustacean corp offered me a job, but there\u2019s something not
      right about those guys"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34
    m_Localized: "I\u2019m volunteering for the new research project!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 35
    m_Localized: "My lollipop\u2026where did it go\u2026 ;("
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36
    m_Localized: "My best friend\u2019s name is Samuel! What\u2019s your best friend\u2019s
      name?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37
    m_Localized: "Samuel looked funny today\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 38
    m_Localized: Mom always looks so cool in her white jacket!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39
    m_Localized: Mom makes the best food in the whole wide sea!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40
    m_Localized: "School\u2019s so boring\u2026mister will you play with me and Samuel?
      \u2026Aww ok."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41
    m_Localized: What candies do I like? Mm, I like jawbreakers and rock candies,
      but lollipops are my fav!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 42
    m_Localized: Mister! I got my favorite strawberry-banana lollipop today! Do you
      want one too?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43
    m_Localized: "They didn\u2019t have strawberry-banana at the store today\u2026That\u2019s
      my favorite\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44
    m_Localized: "I like my mom, I like Samuel, I like strawberry-banana lollipops\u2026and
      I like you too!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45
    m_Localized: "I just love the rain, don\u2019t you?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 46
    m_Localized: "I don\u2019t need to buy a ticket for a plant, right?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47
    m_Localized: I can bring my sign on the train, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48
    m_Localized: My plant Shelldon looks a little wilted today
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49
    m_Localized: I put all my pots outside today to catch the water
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50
    m_Localized: Can I bring eggplant parm on the train?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51
    m_Localized: You should come to my next protest!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52
    m_Localized: You ever think the dark clouds are trying to tell us something?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53
    m_Localized: The new labs are just further marginalizing us fish
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 54
    m_Localized: "If I chain myself to the front of the lab, do you think they\u2019d
      cease operations?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 55
    m_Localized: Ah, this aged shell of mine creaks so. Send an old soul on his way,
      young lad?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56
    m_Localized: There was a time when all beings roamed the seabed. Indeed, one
      misses those days long gone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57
    m_Localized: Those who one once traveled with are now long gone, their traces
      vanished from this world.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 58
    m_Localized: Hmph! Compared to yesteryear, the hunters of this age are scrawny
      beings.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 59
    m_Localized: "Forgive this body\u2019s torpidness; one has been bound to this
      wheelchair for a long while."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 60
    m_Localized: "Young lad, don\u2019t make the same mistakes one did. If you can
      save someone, do not stand by and send them to their deaths."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61
    m_Localized: "One still hears their voices screaming\u2026one cannot tell if
      they are from dreams of old or sufferings of the present."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 62
    m_Localized: "Technology and transportation are so advanced these days\u2026one
      cannot help but feel like a foreigner in this age."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 63
    m_Localized: Young lad, you should get out and enjoy this life with your loved
      ones. Do not dedicate your life to survival, and end up being the last lonely
      one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 64
    m_Localized: "...My friends? \u2026They were known in the history books as brave
      warriors, but one wishes to remember them outside of their assigned descriptions."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65
    m_Localized: ...do not hesitate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 66
    m_Localized: I need more money to afford all my bows
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 67
    m_Localized: I wish it were a bit colder today
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 68
    m_Localized: "You\u2019d look cuter with a bow too!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 69
    m_Localized: "I can\u2019t wait to curl up on the train and read"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70
    m_Localized: "You aren\u2019t supposed to wear blue today, you know"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 71
    m_Localized: Do you think I talk too quietly?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72
    m_Localized: "I don\u2019t like making eye contact. Could you not look at me
      when I look at you?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73
    m_Localized: "I hope that new lab could use a secretary... I\u2019ve been applying
      since forever."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74
    m_Localized: "Hey kiddo! I\u2019m fresh out of jokes, if you\u2019ve got any,
      let minnow!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 75
    m_Localized: "I hope Billie and Millie are doing well in school\u2026 nah, they\u2019re
      stars like you and me kiddo!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76
    m_Localized: "Psst hey, know where the best flower field around here is? No this
      isn\u2019t a lead-up to a punchline, I\u2019m being serious!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77
    m_Localized: "I\u2019m so pumped right now! Managed to snag the last few Basalt
      concert tickets before I got off work!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 78
    m_Localized: "Ooh, you look real fresh today! Got a date? Need some tips? Don\u2019t
      worry, they\u2019re free of charge! Unlike these ticket prices\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 79
    m_Localized: This wildflower bouquet? I make one for my wife every time I get
      to go back home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80
    m_Localized: "Hey what did the two oceans say to each other? Nothing, they just
      waved! HAHA! \u2026oh, I guess you\u2019ve heard that one too much, hmm\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 81
    m_Localized: I just want my family to be safe and live happily.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 82
    m_Localized: "I think I\u2019m going to quit real soon. I just\u2026I can find
      a safer job out there, closer to my family."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83
    m_Localized: Gramps told me you were handsome and he was right!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84
    m_Localized: "Any crustaceans you\u2019ve got your eye on?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85
    m_Localized: "Today is a beautiful day isn\u2019t it?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 86
    m_Localized: I just love taking the train this time of year
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87
    m_Localized: It was me and Gramps' 50th anniversary yesterday!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88
    m_Localized: "Let me set you up with my granddaughter... You\u2019d love her!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89
    m_Localized: I found a husband for that granddaughter I mentioned and they're
      so happy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90
    m_Localized: I heard you might have a secret admirer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 91
    m_Localized: "I see the way the mailkeeper looks at you, he\u2019s smitten"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 92
    m_Localized: "If you happen to have a date with that mailkeeper in the future,
      I\u2019d wear something else."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93
    m_Localized: I hope they give you enough breaks here
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94
    m_Localized: Make sure to stop and smell the sea breeze
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95
    m_Localized: How many times can you let the same thing get you down?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96
    m_Localized: Remember to tell others that you love them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97
    m_Localized: Never forget you can always begin anew
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 98
    m_Localized: Sunny days and rainy days are both days where anything is possible
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 99
    m_Localized: "Don\u2019t wait for new opportunities go find them"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100
    m_Localized: In bad times, good things are always waiting just over the horizon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 101
    m_Localized: Taking care of something else gives you reason to keep going
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 102
    m_Localized: You doing alright, kid?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103
    m_Localized: Something on your mind?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104
    m_Localized: "\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 105
    m_Localized: A lot of folks out there owe you their livelihoods, you know.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 106
    m_Localized: "A lot of lives might have been ruined, if it weren\u2019t for you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 107
    m_Localized: "But that\u2019s cold comfort, ain\u2019t it?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 108
    m_Localized: "\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 109
    m_Localized: "I\u2019m sorry about your pet, kid."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 110
    m_Localized: "I started noticing a while back you took it out less and less,
      and lately I haven\u2019t seen it at all."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 111
    m_Localized: Something tells me you had to give it up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 112
    m_Localized: "\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 113
    m_Localized: Can I tell you a story?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 114
    m_Localized: Back when I was young I met a girl. Loved her with all my heart.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115
    m_Localized: We rushed through things, got married, and I ended up with a family
      before I could really handle it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 116
    m_Localized: We had trouble making ends meet, even with both of us working jobs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 117
    m_Localized: One of us needed to get an education if we wanted to give our kids
      the lives they deserved.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 118
    m_Localized: So I joined the navy. It paid well and it made sure I could get
      through college by the end of things.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 119
    m_Localized: I spent two years there, during the Ammonite War, just loading craft.
      Arming them with torpedoes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 120
    m_Localized: I never even set foot on a ship.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 121
    m_Localized: Well, the war ended, I got a degree in engineering, and started
      working for a train company.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 122
    m_Localized: A little one, a subsidiary of a place called \"Crustacean Corporation.\"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 123
    m_Localized: "They were doing some sketchy things, but I didn\u2019t think much
      of it. The job was paying for my own kids to go to college, after all."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 124
    m_Localized: It let me afford a trip around the world each year.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125
    m_Localized: Then one year, I took a trip to Ammonatia.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 126
    m_Localized: "I stumbled on one of the places the navy visited, and saw fossil
      after fossil after fossil littering the ground\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 127
    m_Localized: "\u2026all surrounded by old torpedo shells."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 128
    m_Localized: And I realized, like you did, that I was responsible.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 129
    m_Localized: I never captained the ships.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 130
    m_Localized: I never fired the torpedoes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 131
    m_Localized: But any one of the torpedoes there could have been loaded by me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 132
    m_Localized: "And maybe if I hadn\u2019t been there, a few more ammonites would
      have lived."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133
    m_Localized: "\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 134
    m_Localized: I quit my job as a train engineer the moment I got back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 135
    m_Localized: "I started working at a mom and pop mechanic\u2019s shop instead."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 136
    m_Localized: "I didn\u2019t go on another vacation for thirty years."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137
    m_Localized: "But I can sleep well each night, knowing I left that train company
      before\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 138
    m_Localized: "\u2026this happened."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 139
    m_Localized: "\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140
    m_Localized: "It\u2019s gonna be a hard few weeks, kid. And a hard few years
      after that, while you get back on your feet."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 141
    m_Localized: "But I hope you don\u2019t regret a second of it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 142
    m_Localized: "You should get yourself something nice\u2026 you deserve it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143
    m_Localized: Did you read my letter?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 144
    m_Localized: "Do you think you\u2019ll ever love someone more than your isopod?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 145
    m_Localized: "You got more mail than usual this week, do you have an admirer
      I don\u2019t know about?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 146
    m_Localized: "You spend money on things besides your isopod, right\u2026?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147
    m_Localized: "We should get lunch sometime when we\u2019re both on break, I promise
      I won\u2019t bore you\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 148
    m_Localized: You ever think about getting out of here..? I do, but you make staying
      worthwhile.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 149
    m_Localized: "You know, I\u2019ve started to wonder if I see you less than your
      vet does\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 150
    m_Localized: "I saw Gramps chatting with you\u2026 was he telling you to open
      a Roth IRA again?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 151
    m_Localized: "I knew you were more than just a pretty face, you\u2019ve got strong
      morals too. I like that in a person."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 152
    m_Localized: A lot of people want to thank you, you know.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 153
    m_Localized: "I guess you were just another pretty face after all, and I really
      did believe in you\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 154
    m_Localized: "...well, I hope you\u2019re at least having a good day."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 155
    m_Localized: Hey there, how are we doing today?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 156
    m_Localized: "Just here for a regular checkup for your lil\u2019 one here? Mm,
      we\u2019ll see about that\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 157
    m_Localized: "Ohhhh\u2026hmm\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 158
    m_Localized: Well, your buddy here is not doing too hot right now!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 159
    m_Localized: Look at him! One of his legs is shorter than the other; this is
      clearly a sign of malnutrition!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 160
    m_Localized: "No no, I\u2019m not saying you\u2019re not doing a good job of
      raising them."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 161
    m_Localized: "Your isopod simply isn\u2019t getting enough nutrients."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 162
    m_Localized: You know how the store brands are nowadays, always processed and
      full of fillers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 163
    m_Localized: Here, I personally recommend this brand right here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 164
    m_Localized: "It\u2019s a bit more expensive, yes, but I promise it is much more
      nutrient-packed and natural."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 165
    m_Localized: I highly suggest you switch soon, otherwise your isopod will be
      at considerable risk of falling ill.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 166
    m_Localized: "What do I mean? You see\u2026it\u2019s not just the food."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167
    m_Localized: It appears your isopod has a severe chronic respiratory illness.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 168
    m_Localized: "This appears to be something genetic; your isopod\u2019s gills
      are unable to properly absorb oxygen."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 169
    m_Localized: Over time, this will cause severe issues and will certainly lead
      to an early death.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 170
    m_Localized: "We\u2019ll need to take a tissue sample for testing to see which
      medicine will work best."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 171
    m_Localized: "At the very worst, we may need to do surgery to replace your isopod\u2019s
      gills with artificial ones."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 172
    m_Localized: "I\u2019m very sorry to be the bearer of such bad news."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 173
    m_Localized: "I\u2019ll prescribe some medicinal flakes for this week, and we\u2019ll
      get that sample taken today."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 174
    m_Localized: Please trust that I will do my absolute best to save your beloved
      isopod.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 175
    m_Localized: Your total today comes up to about 800 dollars.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 176
    m_Localized: "\u2026What\u2019s with that face?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 177
    m_Localized: "Hey there, hope you\u2019re both doing well!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 178
    m_Localized: "I\u2019ll first do a wellness checkup on your lil\u2019 guy, and
      then we\u2019ll discuss the test results."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 179
    m_Localized: "Hmm\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 180
    m_Localized: "Well, here\u2019s the good news. Your isopod is relatively stable
      and doing much better than last week."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 181
    m_Localized: The bad news is the test results.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 182
    m_Localized: From now on, your isopod will need regular booster shots and medication.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 183
    m_Localized: "However, this won\u2019t be enough. The best solution is artificial
      gills."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 184
    m_Localized: Unfortunately, the level of damage is too severe. Shots and medication
      are only temporary measures.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 185
    m_Localized: The best solution is surgery to replace the gills.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 186
    m_Localized: Unfortunately, this is not covered under your company insurance
      plan.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 187
    m_Localized: You will need to pay out of pocket.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 188
    m_Localized: "We\u2019ll do a booster today, and I\u2019ll prescribe some new
      medication."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 189
    m_Localized: Let me know if you plan to proceed with the surgery by next visit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 190
    m_Localized: "The cost? Well\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 191
    m_Localized: "You should know it won\u2019t be cheap."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192
    m_Localized: "So, you\u2019ve decided to proceed with the surgery? That\u2019s
      good."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 193
    m_Localized: "We\u2019ll schedule it for next week."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 194
    m_Localized: "The shot for today? Yeah yeah, we\u2019ll get to that."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 195
    m_Localized: "You\u2019ll need to make a non-refundable deposit today."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 196
    m_Localized: Yes, today. And non-refundable. How else am I gonna pay off my-
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 197
    m_Localized: Um. Anyways.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198
    m_Localized: "This is standard practice; I don\u2019t know why you\u2019re this
      upset..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 199
    m_Localized: "You don\u2019t have enough for the deposit and the usual treatment
      fees today? Well then\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 200
    m_Localized: "If you\u2019re committed to the surgery, we\u2019ll skip the shot
      today."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 201
    m_Localized: "Yes, skipping the booster today will be fine\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 202
    m_Localized: But taking your isopod off the meds means we have to go through
      with the surgery next week.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 203
    m_Localized: So, you had better scrounge up enough by next week.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 204
    m_Localized: Do you have the money?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 205
    m_Localized: "\u2026Wow. Even with your measly job, you actually got enough?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206
    m_Localized: "Uhhh\u2026not that I know what your job is. The pay just kinda
      indicated it was bad."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 207
    m_Localized: "Well, since you have the full amount today, we\u2019ll put your
      isopod under."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 208
    m_Localized: "Rest assured that we\u2019ll do our absolute best."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 209
    m_Localized: They will pull through.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 210
    m_Localized: Do you have the money?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 211
    m_Localized: "\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 212
    m_Localized: "This isn\u2019t enough."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 213
    m_Localized: "Sorry, do you think we\u2019re a nonprofit? We have mouths to feed
      too."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 214
    m_Localized: "According to our policy, we can\u2019t conduct a procedure unless
      you\u2019ve paid the amount in full."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 215
    m_Localized: "\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 216
    m_Localized: "Begging me won\u2019t do anything. I\u2019m not going to risk my
      job for this."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 217
    m_Localized: "Can you have your money back? I thought this was clear\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 218
    m_Localized: The non-refundable deposit last week was non-refundable.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 219
    m_Localized: "Today\u2019s? Well\u2026that\u2019s the consultation fee. Guess
      what? You just had a consultation."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 220
    m_Localized: So no.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 221
    m_Localized: Oh, you know what? Here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 222
    m_Localized: A complimentary gravestone, on the house, as part of our free aftercare
      package for all our patients.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 223
    m_Localized: Toodles!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 224
    m_Localized: "drip\u2026drip\u2026drip"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 225
    m_Localized: grrregghhhhh
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 226
    m_Localized: "let\u2026me\u2026go\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227
    m_Localized: squawacklackclackclackclack
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 228
    m_Localized: '*squish* (sound effect)'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 229
    m_Localized: man these legs are nice! Right? RIGHT???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 230
    m_Localized: graaawwwwwrrrr
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 231
    m_Localized: rrrrrgggghhhhh
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
